OL,3,AUN court delivering judgment over
OL,4,Awhether Myanmar committed genocide
OL,5,Aagainst Rohingya
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe International Court of Justice
OL,8,F(ICJ) is delivering what is expected to
OL,9,Fbe a landmark judgment on Myanmar,
OL,10,Fwhich is accused of committing genocide
OL,11,Fagainst its Rohingya minority
OL,13,FDelivering the judgement, Judge Yuji
OL,14,FIwasawa says there is a "reasonable
OL,15,Finference that Myanmar security forces
OL,16,Facted with genocidal intent", and
OL,17,FMyanmar had the "intention to destroy"
OL,18,Fa substantial part of the Rohingya
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
