OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUN court delivering judgment over
OL,4,Awhether Myanmar committed genocide
OL,5,Aagainst Rohingya
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn 2017, a military crackdown killed
OL,8,Fthousands of Rohingya and forced more
OL,9,Fthan 700,000 to flee Buddhist-majority
OL,10,FMyanmar for neighbouring Bangladesh
OL,12,FMyanmar denies genocide in the case
OL,13,Fbrought by The Gambia and says its
OL,14,Fforces were responding to attacks by
OL,15,Farmed groups
OL,17,FThe ruling is being watched closely for
OL,18,Fany repercussions it might have on
OL,19,Fother genocide cases, including one
OL,20,Fbrought by South Africa against Israel
OL,21,Fover the war in Gaza
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
