OL,3,AUN court delivering judgment over
OL,4,Awhether Myanmar committed genocide
OL,5,Aagainst Rohingya
OL,6,
OL,7,FNo state has ever been found guilty by
OL,8,Fan international court of committing
OL,9,Fgenocide
